    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't change the reality. my dad worked three jobs so i could go to this school and now i'm barely hanging on and i've wasted all that time and money. the shame is just constant. it's like every time i look in the mirror i just see a reminder of everything they lost for someone who couldn't even make it. i just want to stop feeling this way.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
