      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shame you feel is a heavy cloak, but it's also a very real signal that you are deeply hurting, and that pain is something you deserve to stop. Instead of letting the memory of their sacrifice fuel this constant self-loathing, think about how much more peace you could find if you just let go of the pressure to be perfect. A single, small act of letting go—maybe even just a deep breath—can be a start to silencing that relentless internal critic.",
